Token budget: do not read all of `docs/` or recap every phase.

First coding step in a conversation: read `docs/agent-context/INDEX.md` and `docs/agent-context/STATE.md` once. Then open only the files the INDEX row lists.

Follow `docs/agent-context/PROTOCOL.md`. After a feature ships, update `STATE.md` in the same PR (replace lines, keep it ≤80 lines).

Use Grep before Read. Prefer `offset`/`limit` on large specs.
